==Battleground==
*10 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kenshin Himura (Enemy)|Kenshin Himura]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
**20 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
**10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**1 [[Sanosuke Sagara (Enemy)|Sanosuke Sagara]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

